(6497925, 966203, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Hope it''s doing well.  (no vote, of course)</td>', 'Love it!  Hope it''s doing well.  (no vote, of course)', '2011-08-08 11:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497928, 966195, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like this entry. It has good pattern and rhythm to it. There are some things that I find odd... There is a lack of detail in the pile of debris. The pile seems to have lost it''s texture. Overall the photo has a lot of grey and dark without much whites. Did you do something weird to the contrast in PP? Also what is with splotches in the shadows? Did you apply a texture overlay to this image?</td>', 'I like this entry. It has good pattern and rhythm to it. There are some things that I find odd... There is a lack of detail in the pile of debris. The pile seems to have lost it''s texture. Overall the photo has a lot of grey and dark without much whites. Did you do something weird to the contrast in PP? Also what is with splotches in the shadows? Did you apply a texture overlay to this image?', '2011-08-08 11:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497931, 966237, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great edit.  Hope it does well. (not voting, of course)</td>', 'Great edit.  Hope it does well. (not voting, of course)', '2011-08-08 11:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497932, 965937, 10785, '<td valign="top">Really good shadow play here. Also the textures are great. You got awesome details. I like that you kept this in color.</td>', 'Really good shadow play here. Also the textures are great. You got awesome details. I like that you kept this in color.', '2011-08-08 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497933, 966060, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting view point! I like how the broken blinds frame the door. Good light here and I like the rugged processing.</td>', 'Interesting view point! I like how the broken blinds frame the door. Good light here and I like the rugged processing.', '2011-08-08 11:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497937, 966225, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very saturated colors her sort of adds a texture to the photo. The house looks like it was painted with a brush while the rest of the picture looks like a photo. Neat effect. I do see some haloing around the house suggesting you processed the house individually from the rest of the photo. Perhaps you need to be a little tighter with your masking because it really changes the light in some of the shadow areas behind the house.</td>', 'Very saturated colors her sort of adds a texture to the photo. The house looks like it was painted with a brush while the rest of the picture looks like a photo. Neat effect. I do see some haloing around the house suggesting you processed the house individually from the rest of the photo. Perhaps you need to be a little tighter with your masking because it really changes the light in some of the shadow areas behind the house.', '2011-08-08 11:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497938, 966111, 10785, '<td valign="top">I give it a ten and this is definitely my pick for the blue!! Can''t add any critical comments to this one!</td>', 'I give it a ten and this is definitely my pick for the blue!! Can''t add any critical comments to this one!', '2011-08-08 11:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497941, 965345, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and composition.</td>', 'Nice tones and composition.', '2011-08-08 11:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6497944, 966124, 10785, '<td valign="top">Neat light. It almost looks like you are practicing for the film noir challenge!! I like the title too. Those tendril of dereliction move in fast!</td>', 'Neat light. It almost looks like you are practicing for the film noir challenge!! I like the title too. Those tendril of dereliction move in fast!', '2011-08-08 11:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
