(6497950, 965976, 10785, '<td valign="top">I would say your white balance is off here. The color is just too warm. You may have intended it to be that way in post to create complimentary colors with the orange/blue. But to my eye it just looks off.</td>', 'I would say your white balance is off here. The color is just too warm. You may have intended it to be that way in post to create complimentary colors with the orange/blue. But to my eye it just looks off.', '2011-08-08 11:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
