(6497962, 966094, 10785, '<td valign="top">What a perfect exposure! This almost looks like film. You did a great job with that. What needs work is the composition. It needs something to make it more dynamic. As the composition is now being all centered, it is a good static documentary image.</td>', 'What a perfect exposure! This almost looks like film. You did a great job with that. What needs work is the composition. It needs something to make it more dynamic. As the composition is now being all centered, it is a good static documentary image.', '2011-08-08 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
