(6498282, 965789, 135204, '<td valign="top">Interesting building.  I''m not suer if the processing works for me but I like the composition.</td>', 'Interesting building.  I''m not suer if the processing works for me but I like the composition.', '2011-08-08 15:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
