(6498366, 966098, 110533, '<td valign="top">My favorite picture of all. I love the colors of the house in contrast with the grey sky and the muted colors of the grass and flowers. I hope it wins a ribbon.</td>', 'My favorite picture of all. I love the colors of the house in contrast with the grey sky and the muted colors of the grass and flowers. I hope it wins a ribbon.', '2011-08-08 17:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
