(6498886, 966226, 101668, '<td valign="top">Now this is great. My top pick. Wonderful stuff. I hope the ribbon is as blue as the building!</td>', 'Now this is great. My top pick. Wonderful stuff. I hope the ribbon is as blue as the building!', '2011-08-09 04:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
