(6498917, 966135, 60173, '<td valign="top">Composition looks a little off to me for some reason. There''s nothing terribly interesting about the right side, so I would have framed it a little tighter there and had more ocean on the left. <br/> <br/>I do like the processing overall. Maybe a tad too soft.</td>', 'Composition looks a little off to me for some reason. There''s nothing terribly interesting about the right side, so I would have framed it a little tighter there and had more ocean on the left.  I do like the processing overall. Maybe a tad too soft.', '2011-08-09 05:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6498919, 965363, 124815, '<td valign="top">gloriously inviting!</td>', 'gloriously inviting!', '2011-08-09 05:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6498920, 965798, 60173, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. You get the full length of the building and a sense of the view from the home even though you''re facing the the building. There could be a mall in the view of the building now, but you''ve shown us a roaming farm land so the viewer can only imagine more of the same.<br/> <br/>The clouds could have been a little more ideal, but hey, what can ya do? They still had good interest.</td>', 'Excellent composition. You get the full length of the building and a sense of the view from the home even though you''re facing the the building. There could be a mall in the view of the building now, but you''ve shown us a roaming farm land so the viewer can only imagine more of the same. The clouds could have been a little more ideal, but hey, what can ya do? They still had good interest.', '2011-08-09 05:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6498921, 965989, 124815, '<td valign="top">How many times do we say "never again" and it''s over and over again!? The color is wonderfully telling the story.</td>', 'How many times do we say "never again" and it''s over and over again!? The color is wonderfully telling the story.', '2011-08-09 05:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
