(6499204, 965804, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s a small little detail of the abandoned building and shows the state of decay. I do hope you got closer and made some nice abstracts.</td>', 'It''s a small little detail of the abandoned building and shows the state of decay. I do hope you got closer and made some nice abstracts.', '2011-08-09 12:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499213, 966173, 10785, '<td valign="top">What a sad commentary. It has good emotion. The shot itself looks slightly and unintentionally out of focus. Good composition using rule of thirds.</td>', 'What a sad commentary. It has good emotion. The shot itself looks slightly and unintentionally out of focus. Good composition using rule of thirds.', '2011-08-09 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499215, 966236, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like the angle and the processing but not meeting the challenge too well.</td>', 'Like the angle and the processing but not meeting the challenge too well.', '2011-08-09 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499216, 966181, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good angle of view (perspective) and good composition. The light you captured this in doesn''t really give it that gloomy look. Also the sky is a little bland. I would definitely go back and try to study this subject a little more under different lighting, time of day and weather conditions.</td>', 'Good angle of view (perspective) and good composition. The light you captured this in doesn''t really give it that gloomy look. Also the sky is a little bland. I would definitely go back and try to study this subject a little more under different lighting, time of day and weather conditions.', '2011-08-09 12:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499218, 965976, 118154, '<td valign="top">Colours seem to over hot.</td>', 'Colours seem to over hot.', '2011-08-09 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499221, 966206, 117474, '<td valign="top">Love the crop and composition. If the whole building was there I reckon I''d be looking at the point, but now I''m focused right at the door. <br/>10 and fav. I really like this.</td>', 'Love the crop and composition. If the whole building was there I reckon I''d be looking at the point, but now I''m focused right at the door. 10 and fav. I really like this.', '2011-08-09 12:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499223, 966091, 117474, '<td valign="top">Great subject. There appears to be a fair amount of haloing around the edge of the building though. I love the diagonal on this though. 7</td>', 'Great subject. There appears to be a fair amount of haloing around the edge of the building though. I love the diagonal on this though. 7', '2011-08-09 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499224, 965826, 10785, '<td valign="top">The title aids in telling the story by creating the dramatic backdrop of WWII and the tales of heroism that peppered the war. You captured excellent detail and a good sky with interesting perspective and point of view. The Black and white really works well.</td>', 'The title aids in telling the story by creating the dramatic backdrop of WWII and the tales of heroism that peppered the war. You captured excellent detail and a good sky with interesting perspective and point of view. The Black and white really works well.', '2011-08-09 12:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499225, 966091, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see more of the ground than the sky.  To me, this is the equivalent of chopping of someone''s feet.  Cropping closer to the top of the building would have left plenty of interesting sky.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see more of the ground than the sky.  To me, this is the equivalent of chopping of someone''s feet.  Cropping closer to the top of the building would have left plenty of interesting sky.', '2011-08-09 12:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499227, 965550, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like such an interesting location, but I don''t think the HDR look suits it as well as something with richer blacks would have.  The HDR makes this look too grey.</td>', 'This looks like such an interesting location, but I don''t think the HDR look suits it as well as something with richer blacks would have.  The HDR makes this look too grey.', '2011-08-09 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499229, 965378, 61778, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a shot from Portland! I ALMOST went up to Forrest Park and shot this for this challenge myself! <br/> <br/>Very nice job on the lighting!</td>', 'Nice to see a shot from Portland! I ALMOST went up to Forrest Park and shot this for this challenge myself!  Very nice job on the lighting!', '2011-08-09 12:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499230, 965822, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred if this had been taken during sunrise or sunset so there was some detail in the sky and some separation between the sky and the ground.</td>', 'I would have preferred if this had been taken during sunrise or sunset so there was some detail in the sky and some separation between the sky and the ground.', '2011-08-09 12:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499231, 965835, 47470, '<td valign="top">It''s so sad to see buildings with beautiful architecture left to rot and fall apart.  I would have loved to see this building with better lighting.</td>', 'It''s so sad to see buildings with beautiful architecture left to rot and fall apart.  I would have loved to see this building with better lighting.', '2011-08-09 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499234, 965374, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks more like carefully planned, fake decay, as in a commercial haunted house.  Cool clock though, and nice detail.</td>', 'This looks more like carefully planned, fake decay, as in a commercial haunted house.  Cool clock though, and nice detail.', '2011-08-09 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499238, 966041, 47470, '<td valign="top">This building has so much potential.  I would have tried to gain access to the house across the street from here to shoot the building straight on.  Then I would have cropped closer on some detail, probably the tree, roots, and some of the architectural detail along the top.  I probably would have done this in black and white too, to emphasize the texture in the building.  I also would have used a super shallow depth of field to blur the heck out of the background and keep the focus on the gorgeous building.</td>', 'This building has so much potential.  I would have tried to gain access to the house across the street from here to shoot the building straight on.  Then I would have cropped closer on some detail, probably the tree, roots, and some of the architectural detail along the top.  I probably would have done this in black and white too, to emphasize the texture in the building.  I also would have used a super shallow depth of field to blur the heck out of the background and keep the focus on the gorgeous building.', '2011-08-09 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
