(6499455, 965335, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  B&amp;W works really well here.</td>', 'Great composition.  B&W works really well here.', '2011-08-09 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499645, 966135, 132996, '<td valign="top">This image is stunning. The colors, compared to the tones of contrast, give it an otherworldly feel. The building looks like it doesn''t even belong and reminded me slightly of a Jerry Uelsmann work. I also like how the clouds seem to frame the building, like a halo of white.<br/>One thing I didn''t like was the lack of sea. I wish we had a bit more water in the image. My eyes travel to the left and are a bit disappointed.</td>', 'This image is stunning. The colors, compared to the tones of contrast, give it an otherworldly feel. The building looks like it doesn''t even belong and reminded me slightly of a Jerry Uelsmann work. I also like how the clouds seem to frame the building, like a halo of white.One thing I didn''t like was the lack of sea. I wish we had a bit more water in the image. My eyes travel to the left and are a bit disappointed.', '2011-08-09 18:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499652, 966150, 132996, '<td valign="top">I greatly enjoy this image. The faded texture of the leaves is gorgeous and it''s so refreshing to see a normal level of contrast compared to some of the overly sharpened HDR images in this challenge. My eyes are appropriately drawn to that splash of orange brick.<br/>It''s hard to critique images of buildings because it would be hard to alter the image...however, I think the image would be improved by either 1. removing some of the branches on the left to free up that area a bit more or 2. having more branches so that only the upper portion of the wall would be visible.</td>', 'I greatly enjoy this image. The faded texture of the leaves is gorgeous and it''s so refreshing to see a normal level of contrast compared to some of the overly sharpened HDR images in this challenge. My eyes are appropriately drawn to that splash of orange brick.It''s hard to critique images of buildings because it would be hard to alter the image...however, I think the image would be improved by either 1. removing some of the branches on the left to free up that area a bit more or 2. having more branches so that only the upper portion of the wall would be visible.', '2011-08-09 18:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499655, 965300, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love the high-key nature of the image. The starkness of the bare trees evokes the abandoned, desolate feel a lot more than what I''ve seen. The contrast and sharpness is not over done.<br/>The sun adds a little gem to the image.</td>', 'I love the high-key nature of the image. The starkness of the bare trees evokes the abandoned, desolate feel a lot more than what I''ve seen. The contrast and sharpness is not over done.The sun adds a little gem to the image.', '2011-08-09 18:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499676, 966241, 37252, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing how this demonstrated Abandoned Buidings...I don''t even see a real chair here. I do not mean to come across harsh - just do not understand this photo.</td>', 'I''m not seeing how this demonstrated Abandoned Buidings...I don''t even see a real chair here. I do not mean to come across harsh - just do not understand this photo.', '2011-08-09 19:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
