(6499682, 965947, 37252, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines here. Not sure that I would call it an abandoned building though since nothing here conveys that feeling. Still as from an architectural stand point I like it.</td>', 'Interesting lines here. Not sure that I would call it an abandoned building though since nothing here conveys that feeling. Still as from an architectural stand point I like it.', '2011-08-09 19:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
