(6499790, 966111, 130849, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure - great mood.</td>', 'Nice long exposure - great mood.', '2011-08-09 20:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499833, 965550, 75713, '<td valign="top">I voted earlier - I kept coming back to this photo so many times and bumping it. Finally there was no more bumping as I got to 10. The story is so strong and resonates some place within that I don''t even remember - but it is familiar. This shot made me ask myself so many questions - the wood looks strong so how did it end up in the water... I can''t see where it might have slipped down to the water..did the river/water flood and knock it off it''s foundation -  I love the reflections in the water that is filled with floating bits - thank you for the story.</td>', 'I voted earlier - I kept coming back to this photo so many times and bumping it. Finally there was no more bumping as I got to 10. The story is so strong and resonates some place within that I don''t even remember - but it is familiar. This shot made me ask myself so many questions - the wood looks strong so how did it end up in the water... I can''t see where it might have slipped down to the water..did the river/water flood and knock it off it''s foundation -  I love the reflections in the water that is filled with floating bits - thank you for the story.', '2011-08-09 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499839, 966111, 75713, '<td valign="top">I voted earlier - one of my 9''s .. the sky contrasts so well with the grass ... the chimney is so unique and I get the feeling that there is water behind the house even though there is none to see. I like how you photographed it from beneath .. like you are walking up a hill and came across such a wonderful place.</td>', 'I voted earlier - one of my 9''s .. the sky contrasts so well with the grass ... the chimney is so unique and I get the feeling that there is water behind the house even though there is none to see. I like how you photographed it from beneath .. like you are walking up a hill and came across such a wonderful place.', '2011-08-09 21:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499844, 965543, 75713, '<td valign="top">I voted earlier - and I gave you a 9 .. the moss covered rocks are echoed in what is left of the roof .. the dappled sunlight peeking here and there through the trees contributes to the magical feeling this photo conjures up in my mind.  The ivy growing up the tree looks like it is reaching for the remains of the roof to continue the reclamation.  This is one of the times when you don''t need DOF to succeed because everything is in perfect focus.  Excellent pping work that you didn''t take to extremes. I have to give it one more gentle bump and then I can go no further :)</td>', 'I voted earlier - and I gave you a 9 .. the moss covered rocks are echoed in what is left of the roof .. the dappled sunlight peeking here and there through the trees contributes to the magical feeling this photo conjures up in my mind.  The ivy growing up the tree looks like it is reaching for the remains of the roof to continue the reclamation.  This is one of the times when you don''t need DOF to succeed because everything is in perfect focus.  Excellent pping work that you didn''t take to extremes. I have to give it one more gentle bump and then I can go no further :)', '2011-08-09 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499848, 966196, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful find.  The textures are amazing and the composition is strong. I gave you a 9 and would have given you a 10 but found it just a smidgen too light on the left - if it had been filled with shadows it would have made it even more compelling. However, that is a small quibble.</td>', 'What a wonderful find.  The textures are amazing and the composition is strong. I gave you a 9 and would have given you a 10 but found it just a smidgen too light on the left - if it had been filled with shadows it would have made it even more compelling. However, that is a small quibble.', '2011-08-09 21:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499878, 966200, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wow. There is a 1930''s or so woman in the left dooe and a Man in a suit in the right door. I see dead people!! I almost missed it had it not been for the title.</td>', 'Wow. There is a 1930''s or so woman in the left dooe and a Man in a suit in the right door. I see dead people!! I almost missed it had it not been for the title.', '2011-08-09 21:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6499879, 966237, 66398, '<td valign="top">This has the be the absolute best shot in the challenge!!! Excellent job on the edits Maggie. I didn''t see the potential this had before editing. You''re quite the master. (not voting).</td>', 'This has the be the absolute best shot in the challenge!!! Excellent job on the edits Maggie. I didn''t see the potential this had before editing. You''re quite the master. (not voting).', '2011-08-09 21:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
