(6500044, 965332, 112739, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! The Graffiti is just over the top weird. A lone tire and a lone chair top it off. I estimate a top 3 finish.</td>', 'I love this shot! The Graffiti is just over the top weird. A lone tire and a lone chair top it off. I estimate a top 3 finish.', '2011-08-10 00:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
