(6500564, 966098, 48228, '<td valign="top">R I B B O N I just love this from shez</td>', 'R I B B O N I just love this from shez', '2011-08-10 10:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500670, 965429, 117474, '<td valign="top">Really liked the composition of this. The darkness all around set the moody mood. The plant growing inside. The dirty and broken glass. The dust, dirt and grime. The slight tilt. I liked it all. And gave this an 8. <br/>Really nice clean image. The acid bottle is a definite focal point, and while I think the plastic sheet on the left brings depth to the image it''s the only thing that I can think of that people might use to bring down votes. The bright reflections in the folds and valleys. I can''t really call it negative space as it is because there are too many details on it. I dunno though. Maybe it is. but the bright parts do bother me. I might have tried to clone them down a notch were it me. Then again I am prone to over-editing, so perhaps it''s best as it is. <br/>Great focus on this. Nice that the bottle and window are sharp. <br/>Definite 8.</td>', 'Really liked the composition of this. The darkness all around set the moody mood. The plant growing inside. The dirty and broken glass. The dust, dirt and grime. The slight tilt. I liked it all. And gave this an 8. Really nice clean image. The acid bottle is a definite focal point, and while I think the plastic sheet on the left brings depth to the image it''s the only thing that I can think of that people might use to bring down votes. The bright reflections in the folds and valleys. I can''t really call it negative space as it is because there are too many details on it. I dunno though. Maybe it is. but the bright parts do bother me. I might have tried to clone them down a notch were it me. Then again I am prone to over-editing, so perhaps it''s best as it is. Great focus on this. Nice that the bottle and window are sharp. Definite 8.', '2011-08-10 12:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500684, 966117, 136339, '<td valign="top">I find this to be very interesting wiht the train tracks in the picture. Makes me think about how bad it must have been. Great titale. It might have been more dramatic if it was in color.</td>', 'I find this to be very interesting wiht the train tracks in the picture. Makes me think about how bad it must have been. Great titale. It might have been more dramatic if it was in color.', '2011-08-10 12:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500757, 966229, 136718, '<td valign="top">You can feel the hardship and desperation in this image</td>', 'You can feel the hardship and desperation in this image', '2011-08-10 13:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
