(6501655, 966038, 28427, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just adore walking in on things like this, close your eyes and step back in time to see the owners of this car walking around it?  I think it''s a plus you''ve finished it in B&amp;W ,although the color version must be great as well.</td>', 'Don''t you just adore walking in on things like this, close your eyes and step back in time to see the owners of this car walking around it?  I think it''s a plus you''ve finished it in B&W ,although the color version must be great as well.', '2011-08-11 13:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501656, 966241, 28427, '<td valign="top">In a previous challenge I said to Cutout: "even if you would say it''s a cow in a pink tutu..." Now I say: "even if you would say cat in the window" : I''m starting to like images like this one more and more.  The title guides us to what we are supposed to see, but somehow the viewer has the possibility to let work his/her own imagination.</td>', 'In a previous challenge I said to Cutout: "even if you would say it''s a cow in a pink tutu..." Now I say: "even if you would say cat in the window" : I''m starting to like images like this one more and more.  The title guides us to what we are supposed to see, but somehow the viewer has the possibility to let work his/her own imagination.', '2011-08-11 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
