(6501678, 965332, 36133, '<td valign="top">Nice find. Although there''s lots of cool stuff to see, I don''t think it all fits in one shot. Might consider, for instance, cropping out most of what is to the right of the lady on the wall, for a tighter composition.</td>', 'Nice find. Although there''s lots of cool stuff to see, I don''t think it all fits in one shot. Might consider, for instance, cropping out most of what is to the right of the lady on the wall, for a tighter composition.', '2011-08-11 14:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
