(6501684, 966230, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the angle here. Makes for a nice strong image that leads the eye. Looks very similar in structure to the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=927002" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Swift Meatpacking plant</a> here in Ft. Worth. It looks to have lost the external walls in the same manner. I''d expect both buildings were constructed at around the same time period with similar methods.</td>', 'I like the angle here. Makes for a nice strong image that leads the eye. Looks very similar in structure to the Swift Meatpacking plant here in Ft. Worth. It looks to have lost the external walls in the same manner. I''d expect both buildings were constructed at around the same time period with similar methods.', '2011-08-11 14:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501685, 966241, 36133, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with an abstract image, but it should show at least some clue that there is a connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with an abstract image, but it should show at least some clue that there is a connection to the challenge.', '2011-08-11 14:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
