(6501838, 965822, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of lighting! Good to see a different approach to the challenge - I have wanted to try this, so looking forward to hearing your technique - torch or flashgun? Two photos in the same challenge taken no more than ten miles from each other - and quite coincidentally!<br/> <br/>Edit - three photos!</td>', 'Nice bit of lighting! Good to see a different approach to the challenge - I have wanted to try this, so looking forward to hearing your technique - torch or flashgun? Two photos in the same challenge taken no more than ten miles from each other - and quite coincidentally! Edit - three photos!', '2011-08-11 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501845, 965989, 35720, '<td valign="top">The most beautiful photo I have seen here so far, - but I can''t see no abandoned building!</td>', 'The most beautiful photo I have seen here so far, - but I can''t see no abandoned building!', '2011-08-11 18:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
