(6502783, 965989, 126371, '<td valign="top">Great shot. love the composition and subtle colors. IMO, I wish the left part of the sky had withheld some detail...</td>', 'Great shot. love the composition and subtle colors. IMO, I wish the left part of the sky had withheld some detail...', '2011-08-12 14:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502787, 966069, 126371, '<td valign="top">I like the lines this has passing through it. I do wish the bricks right up front were in focus too---IMO.</td>', 'I like the lines this has passing through it. I do wish the bricks right up front were in focus too---IMO.', '2011-08-12 14:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502790, 965798, 126371, '<td valign="top">I really like this image---especially the farmland out in the background. I do always prefer not so harsh shadows (as in the very right part of the building).</td>', 'I really like this image---especially the farmland out in the background. I do always prefer not so harsh shadows (as in the very right part of the building).', '2011-08-12 14:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502791, 966011, 126371, '<td valign="top">Great square crop. Colors are done well, IMO---not overdone. It doesn''t look like the ''saturation'' knob was cranked up all the way! Good shadow detail, too...</td>', 'Great square crop. Colors are done well, IMO---not overdone. It doesn''t look like the ''saturation'' knob was cranked up all the way! Good shadow detail, too...', '2011-08-12 14:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502792, 965966, 126371, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot. IMO, I''d like to see a tad bit more of the tracks. Also, the slpash of pink color on the left is a bit distracting from the subject, but then, what could you do about it?! I hope this does well!</td>', 'GREAT shot. IMO, I''d like to see a tad bit more of the tracks. Also, the slpash of pink color on the left is a bit distracting from the subject, but then, what could you do about it?! I hope this does well!', '2011-08-12 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502796, 966125, 126371, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. O.K, you might think this is VERY picky, but I was wondering what this might have looked like with the seagull in the left part of the sky? Looks like a very fun place to wander along the shoreline!</td>', 'Very nice image. O.K, you might think this is VERY picky, but I was wondering what this might have looked like with the seagull in the left part of the sky? Looks like a very fun place to wander along the shoreline!', '2011-08-12 14:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502798, 966226, 126371, '<td valign="top">I have to say---that is cool... The colors are incredible!</td>', 'I have to say---that is cool... The colors are incredible!', '2011-08-12 14:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502818, 965806, 83313, '<td valign="top">To me, the midday sun is hurting what could have been a very interesting location. I think either early or late in the day would have done nicely for this. Sometimes overcast days work nicely as well, as long as you can keep the blah sky out of the shot.</td>', 'To me, the midday sun is hurting what could have been a very interesting location. I think either early or late in the day would have done nicely for this. Sometimes overcast days work nicely as well, as long as you can keep the blah sky out of the shot.', '2011-08-12 14:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502824, 965750, 83313, '<td valign="top">Though a lot of blur shots appeal to me, this one is not grabbing me in any way and I''m having a hard time seeing the abandoned building here. Just count me as shallow and non-artistic. Thanks.</td>', 'Though a lot of blur shots appeal to me, this one is not grabbing me in any way and I''m having a hard time seeing the abandoned building here. Just count me as shallow and non-artistic. Thanks.', '2011-08-12 14:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
